			"notes": "A lightweight Fabric 1.17.1 mod that allows you to compress various blocks, allowing them to take up less space in chests. Has double compressed variants of all blocks listed below. \n\nCompressible blocks include:\n\n- Dirt\n- Gravel\n- Stone\n- Cobblestone\n- Sand\n- Red Sand\n- Sandstone\n- Andesite\n- Diorite\n- Granite\n- Netherrack\n- Bamboo (turns into a bamboo block, can be used as fuel)\n- Block of Coal (also can be used as fuel)\n- End Stone\n\nRequires Fabric API"
		},
