			"notes": "A lightweight Fabric 1.16.5 mod that allows you to compress various blocks, allowing them to take up less space in chests.\n\nCompressible blocks include:\n\n    \n\n- Dirt\n- Gravel\n- Cobblestone\n- Sand\n- Andesite\n- Diorite\n- Granite\n- Netherrack\n- Bamboo (turns into a bamboo block, can be used as fuel)\n- Block of Coal (also can be used as fuel)\n\n\nLet me know in the comments if I should add double or triple compressed blocks using the previous tier of compression.\n\n \nRequires Fabric API\n\n \nMore blocks will be coming soon, still working on it."
